\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/data-science-vs-machine-learning\/#faq-question-1779100864229\",\"position\":11,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/data-science-vs-machine-learning\/#faq-question-1779100864229\",\"name\":\"11. Which is harder to learn: data science or machine learning?\u00a0\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Machine learning is\u00a0generally considered\u00a0harder because it involves advanced mathematics, algorithms, and model training, while data science focuses more on analytics and visualization.\u00a0\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/data-science-vs-machine-learning\/#faq-question-1779100876190\",\"position\":12,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/data-science-vs-machine-learning\/#faq-question-1779100876190\",\"name\":\"12. What are the career opportunities in data science and machine learning?\u00a0\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Career opportunities include Data Scientist, Data Analyst, Machine Learning Engineer, AI Engineer, Data Engineer, Business Intelligence Analyst, and Deep Learning Engineer across healthcare, finance, e-commerce, and technology industries.\u00a0\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/data-science-vs-machine-learning\/#faq-question-1779100889000\",\"position\":13,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/data-science-vs-machine-learning\/#faq-question-1779100889000\",\"name\":\"13. Do companies hire freshers for machine learning and data science roles?\u00a0\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes, many companies hire freshers for entry-level data science and machine learning roles, especially candidates with strong technical skills, ce